      "generated_answer": "```python\nfrom typing import List\n\ndef findMedianOfUniquenessArray(nums: List[int]) -> int:\n    n = len(nums)\n    total = n * (n + 1) // 2\n    k = (total - 1) // 2 + 1\n    \n    def count_at_most(x: int) -> int:\n        left = 0\n        freq = {}\n        distinct = 0\n        cnt = 0\n        for right in range(n):\n            if nums[right] not in freq:\n                freq[nums[right]] = 0\n            freq[nums[right]] += 1\n            if freq[nums[right]] == 1:\n                distinct += 1\n            while distinct > x and left <= right:\n                freq[nums[left]] -= 1\n                if freq[nums[left]] == 0:\n                    distinct -= 1\n                    del freq[nums[left]]\n                left += 1\n            cnt += (right - left + 1)\n        return cnt\n    \n    low = 1\n    high = n\n    while low < high:\n        mid = (low + high) // 2\n        if count_at_most(mid) >= k:\n            high = mid\n        else:\n            low = mid + 1\n    return low\n```",
