    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\n\nimport sys\nimport math\n\ndef solve() -> None:\n    data = sys.stdin.buffer.read().split()\n    if not data:\n        return\n    it = iter(data)\n    t = int(next(it))\n    out_lines = []\n    for _ in range(t):\n        n = int(next(it))\n        a = [int(next(it)) for _ in range(n)]\n        # prefix sums\n        pref = [0] * (n + 1)\n        for i in range(n):\n            pref[i+1] = pref[i] + a[i]\n        # find all divisors of n\n        divisors = []\n        sqrt_n = int(math.isqrt(n))\n        for d in range(1, sqrt_n + 1):\n            if n % d == 0:\n                divisors.append(d)\n                if d != n // d:\n                    divisors.append(n // d)\n        ans = 0\n        # for each divisor compute max-min difference\n        for k in divisors:\n            # number of blocks\n            blocks = n // k\n            min_sum = None\n            max_sum = None\n            for i in range(blocks):\n                block_sum = pref[(i+1)*k] - pref[i*k]\n                if min_sum is None or block_sum < min_sum:\n                    min_sum = block_sum\n                if max_sum is None or block_sum > max_sum:\n                    max_sum = block_sum\n            diff = max_sum - min_sum\n            if diff > ans:\n                ans = diff\n        out_lines.append(str(ans))\n    sys.stdout.write(\"\\n\".join(out_lines))\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    solve()\n\n```",
