      "generated_answer": "The Populist Party's platform criticizes corporate power, banks, and the failure of major parties to address the people's grievances. The growth of corporate and banking interests likely fueled rural discontent, motivating grassroots political activism. This aligns directly with the party's focus on challenging entrenched economic powers and advocating for reform. \n\n\\boxed{H}",
