    "prediction": "Qwen/Qwen3-Coder-Next",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "McLeach believes that catching an eagle as large as Marahute would make him rich, as he had previously caught and presumably profited from her mate. His excitement upon finding one of Marahute’s feathers confirms he views such a capture as a lucrative opportunity. Thus, he thinks finding and capturing Marahute will bring him significant financial gain.  \n\n\\boxed{\\text{He thinks it will make him rich.}}",
