      "generated_answer": "Nick and his family move to a trailer park in Clearlake because his mother's boyfriend, Jerry, owes money to a group of sailors. They relocate to the trailer park to escape the situation in Oakland.\n\n\\boxed{Nick and his family move to a trailer park because his mother's boyfriend, Jerry, owes money to a group of sailors.}",
