ar to make amends with the two and give them their blessing.\n\nQuestion: Why does Nick and his family move to a trailer park?\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format. Keep your explanation clear, concise, and within 3 sentences.",
    "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "Nick and his family move to a trailer park because Jerry, his mother's boyfriend, owes money to a group of sailors and flees to avoid repayment. The sailors' threats force Jerry to relocate Estelle and Nick to Clearlake. This abrupt move sets off the chain of events leading to Nick's romantic involvement with Sheeni and his rebellious alter-ego. \n\n\\boxed{Jerry's debt to sailors forces the family to relocate to a trailer park to evade payment.}",
