    "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "Adam finally gets rid of his cancer through a risky surgery performed as a last resort after his chemotherapy stops working. During the procedure, doctors successfully remove the malignant tumor despite finding worse bone degradation than expected, and he goes on to recover.\n\n\\boxed{He undergoes a risky surgery that successfully removes the spinal tumor after chemotherapy fails.}",
