      "generated_answer": "McClane stops Stuart and Esperanza by first blocking the plane's ailerons with his jacket to prevent takeoff, then after being knocked off the wing, he opens the fuel hatch and uses his cigarette lighter to ignite the leaking fuel trail. The resulting explosion destroys the jet, killing Stuart, Esperanza, and everyone on board.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{He opens the fuel hatch and ignites the trail of fuel with his lighter, destroying the plane.}}",
