      "generated_answer": "Based on the provided text, the phrase \"In pace requiescat\" does not appear, as the story excerpt ends abruptly at the entrance to the catacombs. However, in the context of the complete work by Edgar Allan Poe, it is the final line of the story and means \"May he rest in peace.\" It is a Latin phrase traditionally used in a funeral or memorial context.\n\n\\boxed{May he rest in peace}",
