\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format. Keep your explanation clear, concise, and within 3 sentences.",
    "prediction": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "\\boxed{Charley shot holes in the roof, which allowed sunlight to enter and kill some vampires while also creating a protective patch of light that guarded him and Peter from the remaining vampires.}",
      "success": true,
      "token_usage": {
        "input_tokens": 888,
        "output_tokens": 218,
        "total_tokens": 1106
      },
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "error": null
    },
    "cost": 0.00057594,
