\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format. Keep your explanation clear, concise, and within 3 sentences.",
    "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "In the film *Fright Night* (1985), **Charley Brewster** shot holes in the roof of Jerry's basement. This action allowed **sunlight to flood in**, killing the vampires trapped inside. Later, Peter Vincent also shot additional holes to expose Jerry to sunlight, aiding in his final defeat. \n\n\\boxed{Charley\\ Brewster\\ shot\\ holes\\ in\\ the\\ roof,\\ allowing\\ sunlight\\ to\\ kill\\ Jerry's\\ vampire\\ victims.}",
