      "generated_answer": "A. yes\n\nThe study demonstrates that mutation status, specifically BRAF, correlates with progression-free survival in patients treated with tyrosine kinase inhibitors. This indicates that molecular profiling provides clinically relevant prognostic information for managing radioiodine-refractory thyroid cancers.\n\n\\boxed{A}",
      "success": true,
