      "generated_answer": "The process described is **persuasion** (or **persuasive communication**). The \"boomerang effect\" occurs when an injunctive message—which specifies how one *should* behave—triggers psychological reactance, causing the recipient to adopt the opposite behavior of what was intended.\n\n\\boxed{Persuasion}",
